{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/7TVxhRpdx0_vjOiGZBzs8g","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:56:53.325307+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/7TVxhRpdx0_vjOiGZBzs8g","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/V0nKwUO4MJEl0w3SASoUaIDXxdcuib2giamqiatu7sG210Evw9xobenUQW5zGPn8nd8tHTXEH24jBGOe8l7Vt7Yhw/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span>以古玉的温润雕琢未来</span></p><p><span>以科技的锋芒叩问未知</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>当夏日的风</span></p><p><span>吹过良渚遗址的星空</span></p><p><span>我们邀请怀揣理想的你</span></p><p><span>与我们一起</span></p><p><span>在实验室的微光里</span></p><p><span>与先民的智慧对话</span></p><p><span>在基因的密码中</span></p><p><span>寻找文明的续章</span></p><p><span>在生物数据的洪流里</span></p><p><span>解读未解的生命诗行</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>20</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>25</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>/ 全国优秀大学生夏令营</span></p></section></section><section></section><section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>为促进优秀大学生之间的交流，帮助大学生群体了解当前生命科学领域的前沿热点问题，培养大学生的科研素养，良渚实验室将于2025年7月举办“全国优秀大学生夏令营”活动，欢迎国内高校优秀大学生报名参营。</span></p></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/V0nKwUO4MJEl0w3SASoUaIDXxdcuib2giaDTgANVvqqhw62U3ZthC6bIvibaaibkibTr7oicECrAcOq68sjZeBgrvSOA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>了解良渚实验室</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>良渚实验室（系统医学与精准诊治浙江省实验室）是首批浙江省实验室，由浙江大学举办，2020年7月挂牌成立。实验室现有遗传与系统性疾病、血液与免疫疾病、重大神经精神疾病及再生医学与衰老干预四大科研主攻方向。实验室定位为大学和生命健康行业交界面的战略科技力量，通过机制创新和科技创新“双轮驱动”，有机荟聚国内外“四支科创队伍”，立体推进科学高峰、先进治疗、产业动力“三大攻关任务”，致力打造具有良渚特征的“基础、临床和产业一体化”发展模式，探索生物医学领域新质生产力发展新路径。实验室还积极探索具有良渚特征的“教科人一体化”，通过举办双创大赛及双创博士学院，开展博士层级的教育，培育一批双创型博士人才队伍及高科技生物医药企业。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/V0nKwUO4MJEl0w3SASoUaIDXxdcuib2gia4eaROqbV1CAVzjKqzF4OapgoSUbiaq5Cec2IakrpPSmOPgfu31A5y6w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/V0nKwUO4MJEl0w3SASoUaIDXxdcuib2gia5DOLXdicAOiaPYibnLuQ3N6qzO5jWKRopFicxIibYluBgGxdzI2IDlF6keQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/V0nKwUO4MJEl0w3SASoUaIDXxdcuib2giaBh5OZ9WkqCov1PMYNjONW8Ebn7icuzzk4KjE4Pze4Px8PRzvSzyuUdA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/V0nKwUO4MJEl0w3SASoUaIDXxdcuib2gia3cQsiadTD7uSGdgssmkp43Xibkkpy4gUnpWcicQfyRXcHQCZEHlDKvUWQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/J9Olt6JBRYLwpzuoI0WGAtRpsKUKREReOJolQiathHapHwXw8xPdQRs6bN2GQDt1qxjnfL4suz6NlUKUGGo2OBg/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>招生专业</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><span><span>招生专业包括遗传学、免疫学、分子与细胞医学、生物信息学、生物物理学、肿瘤学、神经生物学、计算机科学、生物医学工程、干细胞与再生医学等；研究方向涵盖微流控、溶酶体离子通道、细胞器生理、药物筛选、组学药理学、单细胞多组学测序、干细胞与衰老、神经环路机制、结构生物学、原子建模方法、表观遗传学、人工智能与深度学习、蛋白质工程与蛋白质设计、细胞免疫治疗、多组学数据分析、细胞死亡领域、生物信息学、疾病遗传学、生物多样性格局与演化机制的解析、动物复杂性的起源和分子遗传学机制解析、基因治疗、合成免疫学、肿瘤免疫治疗、血细胞功能调控及血液病诊治等。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>活动安排</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动内容</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>开营仪式、学科专业介绍、师生互动、优秀营员选拔（优秀营员将按学历背景分组评选）、参观交流等。</span></p></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>日程安排</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>第一天：</span></strong><span>下午(13:00-18:00) 学员报到登记，安排住宿，熟悉紫金港校园。</span></p><p><strong><span>第二天：</span></strong><span>开营仪式，实验室参观，PI讲座，导师面对面交流。</span></p><p><strong><span>第三天：</span></strong><span>面试及优秀营员选拔，颁发证书，闭营离校。</span></p></section><section><section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>温馨提示</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span>本次夏令营为营员提供</span><strong><span>免费食宿</span></strong><span>，并</span><strong><span>报销</span></strong><strong><span>来杭交通费</span></strong><span>（上限不超过800元，限火车硬座/卧铺席、动车/高铁二等座、飞机经济舱），营员入营报到时须提供纸质票据（飞机提供订单记录or登机牌+发票or航空运输电子客票行程单）进行报销。此外，</span><strong><span>实验室可为参加9月份推免复试的营员报销夏令营返程交通费。</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>报名条件</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.全国优秀大学2026届本科毕业生；</span></p><p><span>2. 学习成绩优秀，对学术研究有浓厚兴趣，愿意从事学术研究工作；</span></p><p><span>3. 英语能力优秀，满足以下条件其中一项：</span></p><p><span>1) 全国大学英语六级考试（CET-6）成绩原则上480分及以上；</span></p><p><span>2) 新托福（TOEFL）考试成绩90分及以上；</span></p><p><span>3) 雅思（IELTS）成绩6.0分及以上；</span></p><p><span>4) 英语专业八级合格；</span></p><p><span>（注：未达到以上英语水平条件，但科研业绩突出或学术潜力优秀的申请人，经审定英语水平要求可放宽到全国大学英语六级考试成绩460分。）</span></p><p><span>4.满足“免试推荐”研究生标准。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>申请流程</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>Join Us</span><span><em><span>！</span></em></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>#</span></strong></span><span>申请者请登录浙江大学研究生院招生管理系统，链接地址：</span><strong><span> https://yjsy.zju.edu.cn/grsinfo/zs/user/login</span></strong><span> ，注册后进行网上报名。 </span></p><p><span><strong><span>#</span></strong></span><strong><span>注意：登录后意向学院选择——医学院，意向二级单位栏目选择——良渚实验室 </span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><strong><span>summer //</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span>2025年盛夏</span></p><p><span>让我们以“科学”为舟</span></p><p><span>以“创新”作楫</span></p><p><span>共赴一场与良渚文明对话</span></p><p><span>跨越时空的学术盛宴</span></p><p><span>良渚的泥土沉淀着</span></p><p><span>历史的重量</span></p><p><span>而你的到来</span></p><p><span>会让这里生长出未来的种子</span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/V0nKwUO4MJEl0w3SASoUaIDXxdcuib2giallWgeCFMickoYxyEaSoNHyicEWicU0SkFYgic1V6qseL08Q79Jpdc6X1WQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg5MTY1NDI1OA==&amp;mid=2247498085&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=0a581f19199ec06d2535e25c5100210d&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/V0nKwUO4MJEl0w3SASoUaIDXxdcuib2giajHyZzOnebBUmqXOLsPFlh7L05aVdTrHWicsgLw6mia8Njb3rFd05Jk4w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/V0nKwUO4MJEl0w3SASoUaIDXxdcuib2giaT6tAHBgp5vXsyNe20G7UkNHDTXYncP9Qsnbb5n9V5PlLn07lKYQMdw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"21f1152a91b1e95aa70f4aea6b795b59f334c8b5952dabab71c596cf7fa2c939","textLength":1546,"sourceSha256":"42cf5261d9b46bef17ceafee958a9434e750a1c1e4d69e0c5d97e22dba7646c4","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-6b47c13764a